OL,3,GNEWSALocal heroes honoured at Make a
OL,4,ADifference Awards
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe FTD Brothers and a 17-year old
OL,7,Fcancer patient were among the winners
OL,8,Fat last night's BBC Radio Hereford and
OL,9,FWorcester's Make a Difference Awards.
OL,11,FBrothers Jordan and Cian Adams and
OL,12,Fteenager Leo Sproson, who saved five
OL,13,Flives raising awareness of the need for
OL,14,Fstem cell donors, were celebrated at
OL,15,Fthe Courtyard in Hereford, with judges
OL,16,Fselecting eight winners from a host of
OL,17,Fnominees.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
