OL,3,GNEWSALocal heroes honoured at Make a
OL,4,ADifference Awards
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe list was whittled down to 32
OL,7,Ffinalists by the panel, which included
OL,8,FParalympians Matthew and Rebecca
OL,9,FRedfern, journalist Mazen Salmou, as
OL,10,Fwell as a number of previous winners.
OL,12,FLaunched during the Covid-19 pandemic,
OL,13,Fthe awards recognise local heroes who
OL,14,Fmake outstanding contributions to their
OL,15,Fcommunities.
